  m_Name: Hero_Hollis_1Star
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: EndlessPull.Runtime::HeroData
  heroName: Hollis
  title: "Cesto de Le\xF1a"
  origin: Bosque de Alder
  bio: "Quema madera en fosas para dar carb\xF3n a la forja; siempre tiznado, siempre
    firme."
  bioEn: He burns wood in pits to supply the forge with charcoal; always sooty, always
    steady.
  bioJa: "\u7089\u306B\u70AD\u3092\u4F9B\u7D66\u3059\u308B\u305F\u3081\u7A74\u3067\u6728\u3092\u71C3\u3084\u3059\u3002\u3044\u3064\u3082\u7164\u3060\u3089\u3051\u3067\u3001\u3044\u3064\u3082\u63FA\u308B\u304C\u306A\u3044\u3002"
  memories:
  - starRank: 0
    unlock: 2
    amount: 16
    text: "El humo de las fosas de carbón se le quedó pegado tanto tiempo que ya no sabe si el olor es suyo."
    textEn: "The smoke from the charcoal pits clung to him so long he no longer knows if the smell is the wood's or his own."
    textJa: "炭焼き穴の煙が長年染みついて、もうその匂いが木のものか自分のものか分からない。"
